<title>USA: USA-STOCKS-OPEN.</title>
<headline>USA-STOCKS-OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow Industrials ran into some profit-taking to open lower on Friday after closing above the 7,000-point mark for the first time yesterday.</p>
<p>The Dow Industrials were down seven at 7,016 and the Nasdaq Composite was down fractionally at 1370.</p>
